msgstr "Opciones para [toVectorDrawable](../functions/toVectorDrawable.md)."

#: packages/core/src/interfaces/VectorDrawableOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The colour applied to the drawable (default `#FF000000`; tint at usage)."
msgstr "El color aplicado al drawable (por defecto `#FF000000`; tinte en el uso)."

#: packages/core/src/type-aliases/IconResolver.md
#: packages/model/src/type-aliases/IconResolver.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Maps an icon code to an [IconEntry](../interfaces/IconEntry.md), or `undefined` when it has no match."
msgstr "Mapea un código de icono a un [IconEntry](../interfaces/IconEntry.md), o `undefined` cuando no tiene coincidencia."

#: packages/core/src/type-aliases/Mode.md
#: packages/utils/src/type-aliases/Mode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The colour mode to collapse `light-dark()` to."
msgstr "El modo de color al que colapsar `light-dark()`."

#: packages/core/src/type-aliases/Theme.md
#: packages/model/src/type-aliases/Theme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A colour theme available in `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`."
msgstr "Un tema de color disponible en `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`."

#: packages/core/src/variables/ICON_COLOR_SPECIAL_VALUES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon colour values that exist nowhere else in the generated tokens."
msgstr "Valores de color de icono que no aparecen en ningún otro lugar de los tokens generados."

#: packages/core/src/variables/ICON_COLOR_SPECIAL_VALUES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `inherit`: the CSS `currentColor` keyword.\n- `ai`: a gradient composed from two `aiSecondary` gradient icon-colour tokens."
msgstr "- `inherit`: la palabra clave CSS `currentColor`.\n- `ai`: un degradado compuesto por dos tokens de color de icono `aiSecondary`."

#: packages/model/src/functions/defineToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a well-formed [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) from partial input, defaulting `syntax` to `\"*\"` and\n`inherits` to `true`. Plugins import this from `@pantoken/model` to avoid depending on\n`@pantoken/core`; for smart CSS syntax inference use `defineToken` from `@pantoken/core`."
msgstr "Construye un [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) bien formado a partir de entrada parcial, estableciendo por defecto `syntax` a `\"*\"` y\n`inherits` a `true`. Los complementos importan esto desde `@pantoken/model` para evitar depender de\n`@pantoken/core`; para la inferencia inteligente de la sintaxis CSS, use `defineToken` de `@pantoken/core`."

#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/model` — the zero-dependency type contracts for the pantoken token IR."
msgstr "`@pantoken/model` — los contratos de tipos sin dependencias para el IR de tokens de pantoken."

#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema (`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\ninitial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and reference values,\nplus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). Icons are rolled in as `<image>` tokens.\nEvery pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer needs the\n(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."
msgstr "A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema (`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\ninitial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and reference values,\nplus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). Icons are rolled in as `&lt;image&gt;` tokens.\nEvery pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer needs the\n(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One entry in the token deprecation ledger — the lifecycle of a single dropped upstream token."
msgstr "Una entrada en el registro de desaprobación de tokens — el ciclo de vida de un único token de origen eliminado."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A shim value comes from EITHER `replacement` (emit `var(replacement)`, so theming flows through) OR\n`value` (freeze the last-known literal, when the drop has no canonical replacement). Exactly one is\nexpected; an entry with neither emits no shim."
msgstr "Un valor shim proviene O BIEN de `replacement` (emite `var(replacement)`, de modo que la tematización fluye) O\n`value` (congela el literal conocido más reciente, cuando la eliminación no tiene un reemplazo canónico). Se espera exactamente uno; una entrada sin ninguno no emite shim."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The dropped upstream token name, e.g. `--instui-component-truncate-text-line-height`."
msgstr "El nombre del token de origen eliminado, p. ej. `--instui-component-truncate-text-line-height`."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream release that dropped it, `<tier>@<version>` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`)."
msgstr "The upstream release that dropped it, `&lt;tier&gt;@&lt;version&gt;` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream MINOR at which the shim is retired, `<tier>@<version>` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.6.0\"`)."
msgstr "The upstream MINOR at which the shim is retired, `&lt;tier&gt;@&lt;version&gt;` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.6.0\"`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Forward the shim to a canonical token (emits `var(replacement)`)."
msgstr "Reenviar el shim a un token canónico (emite `var(replacement)`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
