#: renderers/rehype/src/functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin factory. Returns a transformer that rewrites `:code:` tokens to inline SVG."
msgstr "Una fábrica de complementos de rehype. Devuelve un transformador que reescribe los tokens `:code:` a SVG en línea."

#: renderers/rehype/src/functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
