msgstr "Variable CSS de shadcn → el token de Instructure al que se resuelve."

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a Storybook theme from the Instructure tokens."
msgstr "Crear un tema de Storybook a partir de los tokens de Instructure."

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`\"light\"` or `\"dark\"` (default `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "`\"light\"` o `\"dark\"` (por defecto `\"light\"`)."

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `ThemeVars`-shaped object."
msgstr "Un objeto con forma de `ThemeVars`."

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/storybook` — a Storybook theme built from Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/storybook` — un tema de Storybook construido a partir de tokens de Instructure."

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) returns a plain `ThemeVars`-shaped object (so `@storybook/theming`\nstays an optional peer) with colours resolved concretely from the IR. Pass it to Storybook's\n`manager`/`preview` theme."
msgstr "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) devuelve un objeto plano con la forma `ThemeVars` (por lo que `@storybook/theming`\npermanece como un par opcional) con colores resueltos concretamente desde la IR. Pásalo al tema\n`manager`/`preview` de Storybook."

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"
msgstr "Renombra y vuelve a exportar [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"

#: renderers/storybook/src/type-aliases/StorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Storybook theme object (a subset of `ThemeVars`)."
msgstr "Un objeto de tema de Storybook (un subconjunto de `ThemeVars`)."

