#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Japanese (日本語) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización japonés (日本語)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ko.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Korean (한국말) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización coreano (한국말)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-metric>` — a labelled statistic: a large `value` over a smaller `label`. Both come from\nattributes (escaped), not slots."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-metric&gt;` — a labelled statistic: a large `value` over a smaller `label`. Both come from\nattributes (escaped), not slots."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/mi.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Maori (Reo Māori) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización maorí (Reo Māori)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-modal>` — a real `<dialog>`, so it gets focus trapping, Escape-to-close, and a\n`::backdrop` for free. The `open` attribute drives `showModal()`/`close()`; a native dismissal\n(Escape or a backdrop click) reflects back to the attribute and re-fires as a bubbling `close`\nevent. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands — a\n`<button command=\"--show|--close|--toggle\" commandfor=\"modal-id\">` toggles it by id. Content goes\nin the default slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-modal&gt;` — a real `&lt;dialog&gt;`, so it gets focus trapping, Escape-to-close, and a\n`::backdrop` for free. The `open` attribute drives `showModal()`/`close()`; a native dismissal\n(Escape or a backdrop click) reflects back to the attribute and re-fires as a bubbling `close`\nevent. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands — a\n`<button command=\"--show|--close|--toggle\" commandfor=\"modal-id\">` toggles it by id. Content goes\nin the default slot."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ms.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Malaysian (Bahasa Melayu) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización malasio (Bahasa Melayu)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/nb.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Norwegian Bokmål (Norsk Bokmål) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización para Norwegian Bokmål (Norsk Bokmål)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/nl.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dutch (Nederlands) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización en neerlandés (Nederlands)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/nn.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Norwegian Nynorsk (Norsk Nynorsk) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización en noruego Nynorsk (Norsk Nynorsk)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-pages>` — shows one slotted `[data-page]` panel at a time, swapping with the View\nTransitions API when available (a plain toggle otherwise). `push(id)`/`back()` keep a history\nstack; the `active` attribute reflects the current page and can be set to navigate, and a bubbling\n`change` event (`detail.page`) fires per swap. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands:\n`<button command=\"--push\" commandfor=\"pages-id\" data-page=\"…\">` and\n`<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"pages-id\">`."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-pages&gt;` — shows one slotted `[data-page]` panel at a time, swapping with the View\nTransitions API when available (a plain toggle otherwise). `push(id)`/`back()` keep a history\nstack; the `active` attribute reflects the current page and can be set to navigate, and a bubbling\n`change` event (`detail.page`) fires per swap. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands:\n`<button command=\"--push\" commandfor=\"pages-id\" data-page=\"…\">` and\n`<button command=\"--back\" commandfor=\"pages-id\">`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-pill>` — a compact status pill. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-<variant>`\nmodifier; slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-pill&gt;` — a compact status pill. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`\nmodifier; slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pl.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Polish (Polski) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización en polaco (Polski)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-popover>` — a floating surface. Like `<instui-context-view>`, the host is a native\n`[popover]` (top layer + light-dismiss), so a light-DOM `popovertarget` button can toggle it by id.\nContent goes in the default slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-popover&gt;` — a floating surface. Like `&lt;instui-context-view&gt;`, the host is a native\n`[popover]` (top layer + light-dismiss), so a light-DOM `popovertarget` button can toggle it by id.\nContent goes in the default slot."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-progress>` — a horizontal indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-progress&gt;` — a horizontal indicator backed by native `&lt;progress&gt;` or `&lt;meter&gt;` semantics."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. `variant` maps the\ncomponent to `-color-<variant>` and `label` supplies its accessible name."
msgstr "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `&lt;progress&gt;`; a non-zero minimum renders `&lt;meter&gt;`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to transition meter changes over half a second. `variant` maps the\ncomponent to `-color-&lt;variant&gt;` and `label` supplies its accessible name."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-progress-circle>` — a circular indicator backed by native `<progress>` or `<meter>` semantics."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-progress-circle&gt;` — a circular indicator backed by native `&lt;progress&gt;` or `&lt;meter&gt;` semantics."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/progressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `<progress>`; a non-zero minimum renders `<meter>`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to animate from zero on mount; `animation-delay` is a millisecond delay.\n`label` overrides the accessible name (which otherwise defaults to the percentage)."
msgstr "`value-now`/`value` drive `--value`, while `min` and `value-max`/`max` drive the range. A zero\nminimum renders a native `&lt;progress&gt;`; a non-zero minimum renders `&lt;meter&gt;`. Add the boolean\n`should-animate` attribute to animate from zero on mount; `animation-delay` is a millisecond delay.\n`label` overrides the accessible name (which otherwise defaults to the percentage)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/pt.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Portuguese (Português) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización en portugués (Português)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ptBR.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Portuguese Brazil (Português do Brasil) locale bundle."
msgstr "Paquete de localización para Portuguese Brazil (Português do Brasil)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-rating>` — a star rating with `role=\"img\"`. `value` is the number of filled stars, `max`\nthe total (default 5), and `label` overrides the accessible name (defaults to `value/max`). Stars\nrender as inline SVG glyphs (solid = filled), sized to the text."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-rating&gt;` — a star rating with `role=\"img\"`. `value` is the number of filled stars, `max`\nthe total (default 5), and `label` overrides the accessible name (defaults to `value/max`). Stars\nrender as inline SVG glyphs (solid = filled), sized to the text."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ru.md
#, no-c-format
